This directory contains an unmodified copy of `lean/OAI/Geometry/BallPacking/` from

  https://github.com/openai/math  (commit 1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a, 2026-10-12)

accompanying the OpenAI preprint "Symplectic Ball Packings in Higher Dimensions" (2026-09-23).
It is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see `vendor/LICENSE`.
Any copyright notices in the original files are retained. No file in this directory has been modified.
Any adaptation lives outside `vendor/` (in `SymplecticPacking/`) and is marked as such.
The subdirectory `Geometry/BallPacking/Necessity/` is included for completeness; it is not imported by this development and is not built by the default Lake targets.
